# Working docs and launch notes. Held back until after launch -- publishing
# is one-way, adding them later is not. Delete these two lines to include.
docs/

# Handoffs and the decisions log. Same reason as docs/: the funding route
# and a personal address live in here.
claude/

# Scratch output folders. These keep reappearing untracked AND unignored,
# which is the dangerous combination: one `git add -A` publishes whatever
# is in them to a public repo. Ignored by name so they cannot come back.
# Currently holds banner PNGs; it has previously held the launch kit and
# the handoffs. Put working files somewhere tracked, or leave them here.
Claude outputs/
claude-outputs/
Claude Outputs/
